/code.py:79:#      source and destination in one panel; each half has a single role.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e3721c99/34/code.py:92:#      enforces that by using a single divider-separated panel.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e3721c99/34/code.py:95:#      the moved-panel solver and the full side-by-side solver on every sample.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e3721c99/34/code.py:96:#    - `main()` assumes the left panel is exactly the original grid; generator\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e3721c99/34/code.py:97:#      verifies that the produced right panel is not equal to either the input\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e3721c99/34/code.py:109:# -- legend panel --\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e3721c99/34/code.py:402:    assert left.shape == right.shape, \"panels must share the same shape\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e3721c99/34/code.py:412:      and colored legend shapes occupy a divider-separated panel near an edge or corner.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e3721c99/34/code.py:421:    Key insight: Topology still determines color, but the answer also requires a panel transformation:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e3721c99/34/code.py:422:    preserve the whole input as a left \"before\" panel and place the moved, recolored arrangement as a right \"after\" panel.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e3721c99/34/code.py:495:    panel_h = random.randint(*PANEL_SIZE_RANGE)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e3721c99/34/code.py:499:        div_r = panel_h\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e3721c99/34/code.py:505:        div_r = GRID_SIZE - 1 - panel_h\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e3721c99/34/code.py:517:    panel_w = random.randint(*PANEL_SIZE_RANGE)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e3721c99/34/code.py:521:        div_c = panel_w\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e3721c99/34/code.py:527:        div_c = GRID_SIZE - 1 - panel_w\n/h