g from panel 1; outside -> non-bg from panel 2.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/7491f3cf/D3/0/code.py:282:    - Wall -> panel 1 if non-bg; otherwise panel 2 fallback when the wall is 4-connected.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/7491f3cf/D3/2/code.py:327:    Composite two pattern tiles into a fourth panel using flood-fill from an indicator pixel.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D3/3/code.py:44:    - The legend panel is reserved by a divider exactly as before, so sprites never overlap the panel.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D3/3/code.py:123:    - The legend lives in the top-left panel, separated by a blue divider line, and consists of\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D3/3/code.py:166:# -- legend panel --\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D3/3/code.py:213:    \"\"\"Place the ordered legend strip in the top-left panel.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/7491f3cf/D12/1/code.py:224:    Composite two pattern tiles into the fourth panel using the wall shape in\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/58490d8a/D9/1/code.py:139:    - Output the full grid: repaint the legend box as a black tally panel with one same-colored dot every other cell, and erase all outside sprites of key colors back to the background.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D3/2/code.py:10:#    - This variant moves all legend information into a fixed top-left corner panel.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D3/2/code.py:39:#        * each swatch is exactly one 2x2 component inside the panel,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D3/2/code.py:45:#    - The legend panel occupies the top-left rectangle and is fenced by an L-divider.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D3/2/code.py:46:#      Sprites are placed outside the panel and also not adjacent to divider cells.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D3/2/code.py:51:#      corner panel, and that the colored items there are plain squares rather than holey\n/home/lix