 all 5x5 border-6 squares that look like the top of an 8x5 marker panel.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/20/code.py:390:    - Color-6 separator columns still split the full grid into legend panel(s) and the central canvas.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/20/code.py:409:    marker_squares = _all_marker_panel_squares(g)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/20/code.py:410:    assert marker_squares, \"no marker panel found\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/20/code.py:429:        panel = g[:, marker_c0 : marker_c0 + 5]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/20/code.py:430:        sprites = _extract_unit_sprites(panel, marker_r0)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/20/code.py:435:        frame_bb = _extract_frame_bbox(panel, [bb_a, bb_b], marker_r0)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/20/code.py:439:        frame = panel[fr0 : fr1 + 1, fc0 : fc1 + 1]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/20/code.py:776:    \"\"\"Draw one legend panel: two sprites, frame, marker square, and rotation patch.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/23/code.py:17:      - left/right legend panels, separator color 6, sprite color-swap on read\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/23/code.py:46:    - 1-2 markers match the 1-2 legend panels; legends are paired with markers left-to-right, which is human-visible and solver-stable\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/23/code.py:50:    - old marker-panel detection assumed a nonzero inner pixel in the 5x5 square; fused task invalidates that and the detector must accept empty interiors\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/23/code.py:99:    right separator run (between canvas and a right-side legend panel).\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/23/code.py:113:def _all_marker_panel_squares(g: np.ndarray) -> list[tuple[int, int]]:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/23/code.py:114:    \"\"\"List all 5x5 border-6 squares that act as the top of an 8x5 legend marker panel.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/23/code.py:258:    - Color-6 separator columns still split the full grid into 1-2 legend panels and a central canvas.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/23/code.py:278:    marker_squares = _all_marker_panel_squares(g)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/23/code.py:279:    assert marker_squares, \"no legend marker panel found\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/23/code.py:282:    assert legend_squares, \"no legend-side marker panel found\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/23/code.py:291:        panel = g[:, marker_c0 : marker_c0 + 5]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/23/code.py:293:        unit = _extract_unit_sprite(panel)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/23/code.py:298:        frame_bb = _extract_frame_bbox(panel, unit_bb, marker_r0)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/23/code.py:302:        frame = panel[fr0 : fr1 + 1, fc0 : fc1 + 1]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/23/code.py:564:    \"\"\"Draw one legend panel with an empty border square and a rotation patch.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/12/code.py:71:#    The updated solver assumes every legend panel still produces exactly one\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/12/code.py:98:    right separator run (between canvas and a right-side legend panel).\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/12/code.py:111:def _all_marker_panel_squares(g: np.ndarray) -> list[tuple[int, int]]:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/12/code.py:112:    \"\"\"List all 5x5 border-6 squares that look like the top of an 8x5 marker panel.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/12/code.py:325:    - Full-height color-6 separator columns isolate the left legend panel and, optionally,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/12/code.py:326:      a right legend panel from the central canvas.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/12/code.py:328:      Each legend panel still contains a top unit sprite, a frame mask, a 5x5 color-6\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/12/code.py:352:    marker_squares = _all_marker_panel_squares(g)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/12/code.py:353:    assert marker_squares, \"no marker panel found\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/12/code.py:372:        panel = g[:, marker_c0 : marker_c0 + 5]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/12/code.py:373:        unit = _extract_unit_sprite(panel)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/12/code.py:378:        frame_bb = _extract_frame_bbox(panel, unit_bb, marker_r0)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/12/code.py:382:        frame = panel[fr0 : fr1 + 1, fc0 : fc1 + 1]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/12/code.py:621:    \"\"\"Draw one legend panel (separator, marker square, rotation patch, sprite, frame).\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/2/code.py:143:    right separator run (between canvas and a right-side legend panel).\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/2/code.py:157:def _all_marker_panel_squares(g: np.ndarray) -> list[tuple[int, int]]:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/2/code.py:158:    \"\"\"List all 5x5 border-6 squares that look like the top of an 8x5 marker panel.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/2/code.py:366:    - Full-height color-6 separator columns isolate the main canvas from one or two 5-column legend panels.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/2/code.py:367:    - Each legend panel contains, from top to bottom, a two-color unit sprite, an outer holey frame, an inner holey frame,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/2/code.py:391:    marker_squares = _all_marker_panel_squares(g)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/2/code.py:392:    assert marker_squares, \"no marker panel found\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/2/code.py:411:        panel = g[:, marker_c0 : marker_c0 + 5]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/2/code.py:412:        unit = _extract_unit_sprite(panel)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/2/code.py:417:        frames = _extract_nested_frames(panel, unit_bb, marker_r0)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/2/code.py:662:    \"\"\"Draw one 5-column legend panel plus its separator column.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/2/code.py:664:    panel = grid[:, col_start : col_start + LEGEND_PANEL_W]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/2/code.py:665:    panel[:] = 0\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/2/code.py:667:    panel[marker_r0 : marker_r0 + 5, :] = 0\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/2/code.py:668:    panel[marker_r0, :] = 6\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/2/code.py:669:    panel[marker_r0 + 4, :] = 6\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/2/code.py:670:    panel[marker_r0 : marker_r0 + 5, 0] = 6\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/2/code.py:671:    panel[marker_r0 : marker_r0 + 5, 4] = 6\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/2/code.py:672:    panel[marker_r0 + 1 + leg[\"pr\"], 1 + leg[\"pc\"]] = 4\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/2/code.py:675:    panel[rr0 : rr0 + 3, :] = 0\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/2/code.py:676:    panel[rr0 : rr0 + 3, 0] = 6\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/2/code.py:677:    panel[rr0 : rr0 + 3, 4] = 6\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/2/code.py:680:    panel[cx_r, cx_c] = 7\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/2/code.py:681:    panel[cx_r + dr, cx_c + dc] = 7\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/2/code.py:684:    panel[1 : 1 + sprite.shape[0], leg[\"sprite_c0\"] : leg[\"sprite_c0\"] + sprite.shape[1]] = sprite\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/2/code.py:686:    outer_region = panel[\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/2/code.py:692:    inner_region = panel[\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/10/code.py:19:#    - D18/0 改动先落地: marker panel 不再固定在底部 8 行，而是改成\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/10/code.py:21:#      必须先识别顶端 sprite，再识别其下方的 frame，最后去 frame 正下方找 panel。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/10/code.py:26:#      同时这整个 marker panel 还不在底部，而是贴着 frame 下缘。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/10/code.py:34:#    - marker panel 仍然紧贴 frame 下方，而不是漂浮到任意高度，避免布局杂乱。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/10/code.py:39:#    - 原 `_all_marker_panel_squares(g)` 依赖 marker 可被全局独立扫描；融合后删除该假设。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/10/code.py:46:#      2) marker panel 恰好位于 frame 下方一行；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/10/code.py:54:#      这样 panel 完整落入网格并且不退化回原题的贴底位置。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/10/code.py:58:#      1) marker panel 跟着 frame 走，不贴底；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/10/code.py:63:#    - sprite、frame、marker panel 仍然沿同一 legend 竖向排布；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/10/code.py:64:#      panel 虽然动态，但始终贴 frame，下方留至少 1 行空白，避免拥挤到底边。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/10/code.py:94:    right separator run (between canvas and a right-side legend panel).\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/10/code.py:150:    This supports the dynamic marker placement: the marker panel can only be located\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/10/code.py:176:def _find_marker_panel_below_frame(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/10/code.py:298:    Reconstruct enlarged sprites from legends with floating marker panels and split anchor codes.\